     OVERVIEW OF THE OPTIONS IN THE LOGICAL UNIT WINDOW
 
     NOTE:  Press <Tab> to toggle between the logical unit window
            and the drive window.
 
 
     Use the logical unit window, to perform the following tasks:
 
          - Create a logical unit by configuring "spare" drives or 
            configuring available drives in an existing drive group
          - Delete a logical unit
          - Modify logical unit parameters
          - Display logical unit parameters
          - Format a logical unit
          - Determine the status of logical units (LUN status)
 
 
